<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Little Secrets</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Normani</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DOPAMINE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7kdTESzUEDWEOYJ9VIvz9m</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.179" end="00:07.187">You say you got a new girl around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.187" end="00:11.779">But I can get it if I want, automatic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.779" end="00:13.352">But I don't want it, she can have it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.352" end="00:17.867">I can't miss it if I already had it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.867" end="00:19.528">Yeah, I heard she been talking down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.528" end="00:24.045">Promise, baby girl, you don't want this static</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.045" end="00:25.632">I snap my fingers make it happen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.632" end="00:30.252">I can have it if I want like it's magic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.252" end="00:33.804">Oh, let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.804" end="00:36.936">Let me up, let me upstage your bitch, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.936" end="00:39.884">Let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.884" end="00:42.575">Let me up, let me upgrade your shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.575" end="00:44.603">Now tell me, who you knowdrippin’ like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.603" end="00:46.103">Who you know standin’ like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.023" end="00:49.154">Who you know thinkin’ like this? (Oo Oo-ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.154" end="00:50.654">Moving on you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.575" end="00:52.182">Oo, you know you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.182" end="00:53.759">Boy, you know you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.759" end="00:56.796" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oo Oo-ooh, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.796" end="00:59.655">Baby, I ain't hiding (Na, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.655" end="01:02.947">But you know where to find it (Na, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.947" end="01:04.556">I know how you like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.556" end="01:07.153" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.153" end="01:08.727">I'm in the mood, I'm a mood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.727" end="01:13.345">Baby, I might have to turn up the judging</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.345" end="01:14.907">Thought you knew me, life's a movie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.907" end="01:19.456">Makin' me sit, it's almost cinematic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.456" end="01:20.956">I heard she been talkin' loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.929" end="01:25.376">Calm it down, we can skip the dramatics</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.376" end="01:27.211">'Cause baby girl, I'm not the enemy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.211" end="01:31.860">But if you bring that energy, I can match it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.860" end="01:35.271">Oh, let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.271" end="01:38.280">Let me up, let me upstage your bitch, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.280" end="01:41.369">Let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.369" end="01:44.048">Let me up, let me upgrade your shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.048" end="01:45.998">Now tell me, who you know drippin’ like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.998" end="01:47.523">Who you know standin’ like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.523" end="01:50.726">Who you know thinkin’ like this? (Oo Oo-ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.726" end="01:52.226">Moving on you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.156" end="01:53.707">Oo, you know you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.707" end="01:55.236">Boy, you know you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.236" end="01:58.383" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh Ooh-ooh, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.383" end="02:01.488">Baby, I ain't hiding (Na, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.488" end="02:04.481">But you know where to find it (Na, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.481" end="02:06.013">I know how you like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.013" end="02:08.283" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.283" end="02:12.207">Come in my way, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.207" end="02:14.423">Can't get caught in a zone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.423" end="02:18.250">Playing your games, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.250" end="02:20.619">I played these games for too long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.619" end="02:24.383">She must not know, but you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.383" end="02:26.706">I can do bad on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.706" end="02:30.482">She must not know, but you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.482" end="02:33.314">Just how I get when I get in the zone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.314" end="02:36.739">Oh, let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.739" end="02:39.863">Let me up, let me upstage your bitch, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.863" end="02:42.984">Let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.984" end="02:45.699">Let me up, let me upgrade your shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.699" end="02:47.443">Now tell me, who you know drippin’ like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.443" end="02:48.989">Who you know standin’ like this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.989" end="02:52.129">Who you know thinkin’ like this? (Oo Oo-ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.129" end="02:53.734">Moving on you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.734" end="02:55.243">Ooh, you know you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.243" end="02:56.747">Boy, you know you like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.747" end="02:59.873" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh Ooh-ooh, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.873" end="03:02.842">Baby, I ain't hiding (Na, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.842" end="03:06.075">But you know where to find it (Na, na, na, na)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.075" end="03:07.575">I know how you like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.531" end="03:15.531" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.817" end="03:38.366">Oh, let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:38.366" end="03:41.432">Let me up, let me upstage your bitch, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.432" end="03:44.422">Let me up, let me up, let me up, let me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.422" end="03:48.422">Let me up, let me upgrade your shit</p></div></body></tt>